		{
			"id": "legend",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Feature map**\nEach block is a group of features: open it to see its canvas, then open a card to read its note.\nCyan edge: the player goes from a feature in one group to a feature in the other.\nWhat a feature uses in code is listed in its note, never drawn.\nIn a group canvas a red card needs a pitch and a green one has one.",
